{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core idea of this game is to simulate a boxer's arms and upper body movement with the movement of your mouse, precisely and intuitively. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think of a real boxing fight \u2014 you won\u2019t have QTEs, parrying systems, or combo lists. All you can rely on is the precise control of your body and fists, so that your punches land in the right places at the right angles, and your head barely escape from your opponent\u2019s fingertips. If you've ever wanted this hardcore experience, then this is the right game for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rotation of the character's upper body is directly mapped to your mouse positions, and the arms are controlled similarly \u2014 just hold the left (or right) mouse button to let the character know which arm should be moved. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds complicated? Don't worry \u2014 the controls are extremely intuitive. Wanna perform a right uppercut? Simply hold the right mouse button and move the mouse down-right to charge, then quickly move it top-left \u2014 just like how you\u2019d throw the punch in real life! After a few fights, you'll find that controlling your character feels just like controlling your own body. (It is highly recommended that players go through the in-game tutorial first, where all of this is clearly explained.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into our game, where every punch, dodge, and movement is at the tip of your fingers - literally! Embrace the challenge, let your intuition guide you, and become the boxing legend you were meant to be!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2548440?t=1752912614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548440/89aff24257cfd8c20a60fddc0c422aa9c4be811f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752912614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548440/09d72e90d61c2